# Survey data and calibration models are never committed: field acquisitions are
# large, project-specific, and belong to the surveys they came from, not to this
# tool. Keep them alongside the data (e.g. D:\<site>_Mag\<date>\) instead.
*.csv
*.npz
*.magdata
*.GEOMAG
*.GPS
*.db3
*.grd
